c Block Store (EBS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#elasticache","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon ElastiCache","description":"Amazon ElastiCache","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T00:13:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#rds","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon RDS","description":"Amazon RDS","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:56+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#gaming","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Gaming","description":"Gaming","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:12+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#save-the-children-spain-devoteam-2025","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"save-the-children-spain-devoteam-2025","dateCreated":"2025-02-20T21:50:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2025-03-07T01:09:54+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eSave the Children Spain, part of a global NGO protecting children\u0026rsquo;s rights, faced challenges with its on-premises data management system. Unable to effectively integrate and analyze information from multiple sources, it struggled to personalize donor outreach and optimize fundraising. Partnering with AWS Premier Consulting Partner Devoteam, it implemented a cloud-based data-lake solution using Amazon Web Services (AWS). This transformation enabled seamless data integration, enhanced donor insights, and improved campaign effectiveness. The new system streamlined operations, reduced costs, and allowed Save the Children Spain to redirect more resources to humanitarian projects, benefiting children in need worldwide.\u003c/p\u003e\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/Save%20the%20Children%20Logo%20200x70px.491babb980be27c18da5181b4073e5658ef5d2f5.png","displayLocation":"Spain","footerInfoText":"2025","industry":"General Public Services","sortDate":"2025-02-20","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/save-the-children-spain-devoteam/","customer-name":"Save the Children Spain","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2025","contentType":"Case Study","headline":"Save the Children Spain Cuts Costs and Improves Campaigns with Devoteam’s AWS-Powered Data Solution"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#spain","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Spain","description":"Spain","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#aurora","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Aurora","description":"Amazon Aurora","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:18+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#general-public-services","l